        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>ABH 0147 Heavy Duty Door Pivot Set</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThese 3/4\" offset pivots are engineered for durability on heavy doors weighing up to 600 pounds. Set includes <a href=\"/products/3-4-inch-offset-top-pivot-hinge-abh-0180\">ABH 0180 top pivot</a> and bottom pivot with installation hardware.  <a href=\"/site/department.cfm?id=519415\"><b>ABH Door Pivots</b></a> are Made in the USA to insure high quality. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nFor tall or heavy doors use <a href=\"/products/heavy-door-3-4-inch-offset-intermediate-pivot-set-abh-019\"><b>ABH 019 Intermediate Offset Pivot</b></a>. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/ABH-0147_size.gif?v=1704354632\" width=\"600\" height=\"300\" border=\"0\" alt=\"ABH 0147 Heavy Door Pivot Set Size\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications:</b> for ABH 0147 Door Pivot Set\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Offset: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Weight: Up to 600 lbs</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Door Size: Up to 3'6\" x 7'0\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Door Size: Up to 4'0\" x 8'6\"</li>\r\n<li>US32D model UL listed for use on 3 hour fire doors</li>\r\n<li>BHMA/ANSI C07162/3530A (modified)</li>\r\n<li><b>Handed - Must specify left hand door or right hand door when ordering</b></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/0147-install.pdf?v=1691093120\" target=\"new\"><b>ABH 0147 Installation Instructions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/0147-template.pdf?v=1691093120\" target=\"new\"><b>ABH 0147 Installation Template (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Important</b> When selecting <b>Door Hand</b> for this pivot hinge: \r\n<br>\r\n1. Stand on the <b>Push Side</b> of the door, facing the door. <br>\r\n2. If the \"Pivot Hinge\" is on your \"Left\", choose \"Left Hand Door\". <br>\r\n3. If the \"Pivot Hinge\" is on your \"Right\", choose \"Right Hand Door\". <br>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/closer-handing.gif?v=1704354510\"  width=\"410\" height=\"195\" border=\"0\"alt=\"door handing\">\r\n</p>",
